		{
			"lines": [
				"# ERC-5792 Batch Transaction Support",
				"",
				"## Overview",
				"",
				"ERC-5792 enables dapps to submit multiple calls as a batch transaction.",
				"WalletChan exposes it only for account types whose current execution path can",
				"preserve the requested semantics:",
				"",
				"| Account Type | Batching Mode | Strategy |",
				"|---|---|---|",
				"| `privateKey` / `seedPhrase` | **Atomic when eligible; sequential fallback** | EIP-7702 + ERC-7821 when a compatible delegate resolves; otherwise ordered individual transactions unless atomic execution is required |",
				"| `safe` | **Safe proposal** | Creates a multisig proposal and keeps the bundle pending until real Safe execution |",
				"| `bankr` | **Atomic** | ERC-7821 encoding → one supported Bankr transaction |",
				"| `ledger` / `impersonator` | **Unsupported** | No ERC-5792 capability is advertised |",
				"",
				"One-call requests use the normal single-transaction path. Sequential fallback",
				"still reduces wallet prompts to one reviewed decision and assigns ordered",
				"nonces, while atomic paths keep the calls in one onchain execution.",
				""
			],
			"startLine": 1
		}
	]
}
